<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>Three20 on 快乐每一天</title><link>https://www.zgia.net/tags/three20/</link><description>Recent content in Three20 on 快乐每一天</description><generator>Hugo -- 0.153.3</generator><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 22 Jul 2011 16:00:41 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://www.zgia.net/tags/three20/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>【文章翻译】URL-Based Navigation/基于URL的导航</title><link>https://www.zgia.net/2011/07/%E6%96%87%E7%AB%A0%E7%BF%BB%E8%AF%91url-based-navigation/%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8Eurl%E7%9A%84%E5%AF%BC%E8%88%AA/</link><pubDate>Fri, 22 Jul 2011 14:00:42 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.zgia.net/2011/07/%E6%96%87%E7%AB%A0%E7%BF%BB%E8%AF%91url-based-navigation/%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8Eurl%E7%9A%84%E5%AF%BC%E8%88%AA/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;平时阅读别人翻译的各类文章，感激之外，自己也想翻译一些技术类文章，主要的目的是用来提高自己的阅读能力。正在学习&lt;a href="http://three20.info/"&gt;Three20&lt;/a&gt;，一个开源的Objective-C类库，用来开发iOS应用。官网上有篇文章讲&lt;a href="http://three20.info/article/2010-10-06-URL-Based-Navigation"&gt;TTNavigator&lt;/a&gt;，于是想翻译过来，动手后却发觉艰难的很。明明意思很清楚，表达出来却词不达意。所幸步子却迈出了，希望大伙阅读之余多提意见，我也会不断的重构这篇翻译。看得不爽，告个罪先。&lt;/p&gt;
